@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 账户充值时序图

' 所有 SQL 操作使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，禁止字符串拼接
actor 用户 as U
participant "Flutter 客户端" as FE
participant "支付控制器" as Ctrl
participant "安全过滤器链" as Security
participant "支付服务" as PS
participant "Mock 支付网关" as Gateway
database 数据库 as DB

U -> FE: 选择充值金额，选择支付方式\n点击"充值"
FE -> Ctrl: HTTP POST /api/v1/payments/recharge\n{amount: 100.00, method: "wechat", idempotencyKey: "<UUID>"}
note right FE : ApiService.recharge()\n请求头带 JWT Token\n必须使用 HTTPS 加密传输，防止凭证泄露\nidempotencyKey 由客户端生成 UUID，确保幂等

group 授权检查 [Spring Security Filter Chain]
  Ctrl -> Security: JwtAuthenticationFilter 解析 Token\n提取 principal (userId, role)

  Security -> Security: @PreAuthorize("isAuthenticated()")
  note right Security : 验证请求携带有效 JWT Token\n不通过则返回 401 Unauthorized
end

group 幂等性检查 [防止重复充值]
  Ctrl -> PS: recharge(userId, amount, method, idempotencyKey)

  PS -> DB: SELECT id FROM payments WHERE gateway_tx_id = ? AND user_id = ?
  note right DB : 通过 idempotencyKey 查询是否已存在相同充值请求\ngateway_tx_id 存储 idempotencyKey 作为幂等键
  DB --> PS: 查询结果

  alt idempotencyKey 已存在
    PS --> Ctrl: 返回已有支付记录 {paymentId}
    note right PS : 幂等处理：直接返回已有的支付记录\n不创建重复充值
    Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 {paymentId, redirectUrl}
    FE --> U: 显示"正在跳转支付..."
    note right FE : 已有相同充值请求，直接返回\n后续流程继续到支付网关
  else idempotencyKey 不存在
    PS -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (id, user_id, charge_record_id, method,\namount, status, gateway_tx_id)\nVALUES (?, ?, NULL, ?, ?, 'pending', ?)\n-- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定\n-- gateway_tx_id 存储 idempotencyKey，UNIQUE 约束防重
    DB --> PS: 支付记录创建成功 (status: pending)
  end
end

PS --> Ctrl: 支付单已创建 {paymentId}
Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 {paymentId, redirectUrl}
FE --> U: 显示"正在跳转支付..."

== 模拟支付网关交互 ==
PS -> Gateway: HTTP POST 模拟支付请求\n{paymentId, amount, method, callbackUrl}
Gateway --> PS: 同步返回 (接受成功)

note right Gateway : Mock 支付网关始终返回 success\n回调签名已模拟\n签名载荷 = HmacSHA256(paymentId + amount + status + secret)\n字段按名称排序后拼接再哈希，减少歧义\n\n每个支付通道（微信/支付宝/银联）使用独立 API Key\n单通道密钥泄露不影响其他通道安全

Gateway -> PS: HTTP POST 异步回调\n{paymentId, txId, status: 'success', signature}\nHeaders: {X-Payment-Gateway-Key: <共享密钥>}

note right Gateway : 回调请求需携带 X-Payment-Gateway-Key 头\n共享密钥由系统配置，仅支付网关和后端知晓\n作为第一道防线防止伪造回调

PS -> PS: 校验 X-Payment-Gateway-Key 头\n与配置的共享密钥比对
note right PS : API 密钥认证先于 HMAC 签名校验\n双重验证确保回调来源可信\n密钥不匹配直接拒绝，返回 403

PS -> PS: 校验回调签名 (HMAC-SHA256)

group 幂等性检查 [防止重复回调]
    PS -> DB: SELECT status FROM payments WHERE id = ?
    DB --> PS: 支付状态

    alt status = 'success' （已处理）
      PS --> Gateway: 直接返回成功（幂等）
      note right PS : 幂等键机制:\n paymentId 天然幂等,\n重复回调直接跳过
    else status = 'pending'
      group 事务 [atomic] 覆盖: 更新支付状态 + 更新余额 + 审计日志
        alt 签名验证通过
          PS -> DB: UPDATE payments SET status = 'success',\ngateway_tx_id = ? WHERE id = ? AND status = 'pending'
          DB --> PS: 支付状态更新成功

          PS -> DB: UPDATE users SET balance = balance + ?\nWHERE id = ? -- 使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定
          DB --> PS: 余额更新成功

          group 欠费自动补扣 [检查用户是否有未支付的充电欠费]
            PS -> DB: SELECT cr.id, cr.fee, cr.deduction_status, u.balance\nFROM charge_records cr\nJOIN users u ON cr.user_id = u.id\nWHERE cr.user_id = ? AND cr.deduction_status = 'arrears'\nFOR UPDATE
            note right DB : 使用 FOR UPDATE 锁定欠费记录行\n防止并发充值导致重复扣费
            DB --> PS: 欠费记录列表

            alt 存在欠费记录
              loop 逐条处理欠费 [按时间顺序]
                PS -> DB: UPDATE charge_records SET deduction_status = 'paid'\nWHERE id = ? AND deduction_status = 'arrears'
                DB --> PS: 扣费状态更新

                PS -> DB: UPDATE users SET balance = balance - ?\nWHERE id = ? AND balance >= ?
                DB --> PS: 余额扣减

                PS -> DB: UPDATE users SET frozen_until = NULL\nWHERE id = ? AND frozen_until IS NOT NULL
                note right DB : 还清欠费后清除冻结时间\n用户恢复正常使用
                DB --> PS: 冻结清除

                PS -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (id, user_id, charge_record_id, method,\namount, status)\nVALUES (?, ?, ?, 'auto_deduct', ?, 'success')
                DB --> PS: 补扣支付记录

                PS -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor_id, actor_type, action, resource, resource_id, payload)\nVALUES (?, 'system', 'arrears_auto_deduct', 'charge_record', ?, ?::jsonb)
                DB --> PS: 补扣审计日志
              end
            else 无欠费记录
              note right PS : 无欠费记录，无需补扣
            end
          end

          PS -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor_id, actor_type, action, resource, resource_id, client_ip)\nVALUES (?, 'user', 'recharge', 'payment', ?, ?)
          DB --> PS: 审计日志记录成功
        else 签名验证失败
	          PS -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (actor_id, actor_type, action, resource, resource_id, payload) VALUES (?, 'system', 'callback_signature_failed', 'payment', ?, ?::jsonb) -- 记录签名校验失败审计日志
	          DB --> PS: 审计日志记录成功
          PS -> DB: UPDATE payments SET status = 'failed'\nWHERE id = ?
          DB --> PS: 标记失败
        end
      end
    end
end

Gateway --> PS: 回调处理完成

== 前端刷新余额 ==
note right FE : 通过 WebSocket 推送或轮询获取最新余额\nWebSocket 连接需通过 JWT 认证（?token= 或 Sec-WebSocket-Protocol 头）\n此处展示主动刷新方式

U -> FE: 手动刷新余额或收到回调通知
FE -> Ctrl: HTTP GET /api/v1/users/balance
Ctrl -> PS: getBalance(userId)
PS -> DB: SELECT balance FROM users WHERE id = ?
DB --> PS: 当前余额
PS --> Ctrl: balance: 100.00
Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 {balance: 100.00}
FE --> U: 显示"充值成功，当前余额 100.00 元"
@enduml